CSKG — the CommonSense Knowledge Graph
======================================

`cskg-commonsense.json.gz` in this directory is a derived subset of CSKG.

Upstream work
-------------

    Filip Ilievski, Pedro Szekely, Bin Zhang.
    "CSKG: The CommonSense Knowledge Graph."
    Extended Semantic Web Conference (ESWC), 2021.
    https://github.com/usc-isi-i2/cskg

CSKG consolidates ConceptNet 5.7, WordNet 3.0, ATOMIC, Visual Genome, FrameNet,
Roget and Wikidata-CS into one graph with a shared node space.

